ot evaluate it.\n\n![](images/bf/bf8d7feeb69c5e0093cf92b78cdb390a8aae5ee8b117ab637bafb120c4d2a06c.png)" :question/worked-solution "For parametric arc length, use\n\n$$\nL=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{[x\\prime(t)]^2+[y\\prime(t)]^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$\n\nDifferentiate each coordinate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx'(t)&=6 t^{2} + 2 t\\\\\ny'(t)&=6 t^{2} - 2 t.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe cross terms cancel when the two derivative squares are added.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx'(t)^2+y'(t)^2&=72 t^{4} + 8 t^{2}\\\\\n&=(t)^2\\bigl(72 t^{2} + 8\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse $\\sqrt{(t)^2}=|t|$. The factor $t$ changes sign inside this interval, so its absolute value must remain.\n\nUse the given parameter bounds:\n\n$$\nL=\\int_{-2}^{3}\\left|t\\right|\\sqrt{72 t^{2} + 8}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186722547 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf75d056-fcef-5179-986f-726eafc07203" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left(t\\right)^2\\sqrt{18 t^{2} + 8}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186722561} {:answer/id #uuid "d8abbb94-c8d8-5116-b716-cb68f450ad0f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left|t\\right|\\sqrt{32 t^{2} + 18}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186722562} {:answer/id #uuid "e0264e80-8e5f-528d-b146-dbd730637058" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left|t\\right|\\sqrt{18 t^{2} + 8}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186722563} {:answer/id #uuid "e71df554-3d1d-55ed-aa90-40ea4fd3703f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left(t\\right)^2\\sqrt{72 t^{2} + 32}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186722565} {:answer/id #uuid "ee0cc085-013c-58c0-bb56-0e3c7a5de95a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value